  "duration_s": 477.856357,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？二零二六年世界杯决赛西班牙赢了之后，有个人没有冲向奖杯，他冲向了看台，他把大力神杯塞进一个女人怀里。那个女人叫希拉十六岁当妈，麦当劳站了十年，那一天，全世界都在查她的资料，结果查出来的东西比世界杯决赛还好看。今天我们不聊足球，聊聊那个连越位都不懂，却养出了一个世界冠军的女人。希拉不是西班牙人，她出生在赤道几内亚十几岁，一个人飘到巴塞罗那，住进了罗卡芬达，一个连外卖都不愿意送的移民哭。十六岁，他生了一个儿子，孩子他爸是摩洛哥来的油漆工。熊走了，希拉没哭，她只是从此再也没睡过一个整觉。她去麦当劳上夜班，晚上十点站到早上六点回家，给儿儿子做饭，哄他睡觉，再去菜市场捡收他的菜叶子。那是他的青春。十八岁别的女孩化妆，她在洗油烟机，二十岁别的女孩谈恋爱，她在暑映必买打折面包，那双被洗涤剂泡得发白的手。后来抱着一个三个月大的婴儿坐了两小时公交，穿越整座巴塞罗那去接一个叫梅西的男人。二零零七年，巴萨拍慈善日历，梅西会给几个婴儿洗澡，希腊在报纸上看到这条消息，抱起孩子就出发了，他不知道梅西是谁。他只知道，如果这个人能让他的孩子将来过得好一点，那他就去那张合影。希拉存了十九年，他大概也不知道照片里那个帮婴儿洗澡的球星，十几年后会把十号球衣脱给他怀里。那个婴儿穿亚马尔六岁那年在街头踢一颗破网球。希拉看了二十分钟，做了一个让所有人都觉得疯了的决定。他把儿子送进了巴萨青训，邻居笑他，你连报名表上的字都认不全，你儿子能踢出来？希拉说了一句话，我没读过书，但我认得我儿子的眼睛，他看球的时候眼睛里有光。就这一句话，他开始了长达七年的摆渡，拉玛西亚在城内头，希拉筑城这一头，每周三趟公交来回四个小时。他坐在铁丝网外面不玩手机，不聊天就那么看着清旬教练。后来回忆所有孩子里，亚马尔不是最有天赋的，但他是唯一一个。每次回头，妈妈都在场边的，有一回下暴雨训练，临时取消。希腊不知道，他坐了两个小时公交到了发现训练场空无一人。他又坐了两个小时公交回去。这件事亚马尔是后来才知道的，他妈从来不说自己吃了什么苦，他只说今天天气不错，亚马尔十二岁进了拉马西亚，从此他的世界越来越大。梅西欧洲杯十号球衣世界杯希腊的世界一直没变过，还是那个出租屋那双缝鞋的手那趟来回四小时的公交雅马。尔后来说过两件事一件事，有一年圣诞节，希拉给他买了一台游戏机，他长大了才知道那台游戏机是他占了多少个夜班才换来的另一件事。有一天半夜他醒来，看见他妈在灯下缝他的球鞋鞋底开胶了，他用于线缝封了整整一夜。第二天，他穿着那双鞋去训练，踢进了三个球。亚马尔说，我现在身价两亿欧元，但我什么都给不了。我妈，因为他给我的东西钱买不到。二零二四年亚马尔十七岁拿了欧洲杯，二零二五年十八岁接过巴萨十号，全世界都在喊天才，只有亚马尔知道天才不是从天上掉下来的。天才是从罗卡丰达的公交车上坐了七年，来来回回才到的诺坎普。记者问他压力大不大？他说了一段话，我妈十六岁生，我那才是压力。他一个人在麦当劳站了十年，那才是压力。我要做的只是踢好足球。二零二六年世界杯决赛终场哨响，西班牙赢了。亚马尔穿过整座球场，翻过广告牌，冲上看台，一把抱住希拉，把大力神杯塞进他怀里。然后他转身从人群中抱起，一个三岁的小男孩叫凯恩。他弟弟。他把金牌从自己脖子上摘下来，挂在他弟弟脖子上，让那只小手去摸大地神杯。全世界都在拍亚马尔，亚马尔的镜头，只对着两个人，他妈妈和他弟弟他说过一段话，我弟弟每天早晨醒来，有热牛奶，喝有玩具玩，有哥哥陪他踢球。这听起来很普通，但这对我来说是我这辈子拼了命也要守护的画面。因为那是我小时候从从来没有过的早晨。希拉三十五岁，他十六岁生，十七岁抱着孩子坐公交去见维西。三十五岁，站在世界杯领奖台上，大儿子十九岁，小儿子三岁，大儿子把所有的荣誉都变成了弟弟手里的玩具。有人问亚马尔，你职业生涯谁最重要？他说我妈，然后他说小时候我每天最怕的是天亮天亮了，我妈就要去麦当劳了，家里就剩我一个人。现在我最怕的是天亮，天亮了，我弟就有新的一天可以去玩了，我不怕黑了，因为我把光都留给他了。希拉那天站在领奖台上，手里握着大力神杯，身边站着他三岁的小儿子，他没有哭，他笑得不知所措。那个画面被摄影师拍了下来，后来在网上传疯了。照片里只有一个女人，手里握着一座奖杯，身边站着一个孩子，阳光打在他脸上，三十五岁的脸笑得像个小女孩。那张照片底下有一行字是亚马尔后来写上去的。他说，这双手在麦当劳后锄断了十年，盘子被洗涤剂泡白了，被油烟熏皱了，被生活磨粗了。但就是这双手抱我，坐了两个小时公交去见梅西。就是这双手用鱼线给我缝了一整夜的球鞋。就是这双手在无数个凌晨做晚饭，看着我吃完，然后自己去上夜班。十九年后，这双手握住了一座大力神碑。我觉得大力神杯很轻，因为他沃国的生活比他重一万倍。希腊至今不懂越位，不懂战术，不懂什么清训体系，他只知道一件事，他儿子喜欢踢球，他就送他去了，仅此而已。但就是这个连足球规则都搞不清楚的女人，成了世界冠军的榜样，亚马尔的榜样。十六岁当妈，三十五岁，站在世界之巅。这双手端过盘子，也捧过奖杯。这个女人没踢过一脚球，但她生了冠军，养了冠军，最后活成了冠军。如果有一天，你在凌晨的麦当劳看见一个收银员，他手上有洗洁精的味道，他眼里有困意。他动作很快，因为他急着回家看孩子，请你对他笑一下。他手里端的不是盘子，是他儿子的未来。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 1070,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1690,
      "end_ms": 5010,
      "text": "二零二六年世界杯决赛西班牙赢了之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5370,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "有个人没有冲向奖杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7150,
      "end_ms": 8230,
      "text": "他冲向了看台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8810,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "他把大力神杯塞进一个女人怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12010,
      "end_ms": 14890,
      "text": "那个女人叫希拉十六岁当妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15170,
      "end_ms": 16670,
      "text": "麦当劳站了十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17270,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "那一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18150,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "全世界都在查她的资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20350,
      "end_ms": 23610,
      "text": "结果查出来的东西比世界杯决赛还好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24210,
      "end_ms": 25710,
      "text": "今天我们不聊足球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26130,
      "end_ms": 27870,
      "text": "聊聊那个连越位都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28230,
      "end_ms": 31060,
      "text": "却养出了一个世界冠军的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31660,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "希拉不是西班牙人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33860,
      "end_ms": 36600,
      "text": "她出生在赤道几内亚十几岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36600,
      "end_ms": 38300,
      "text": "一个人飘到巴塞罗那，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38640,
      "end_ms": 39980,
      "text": "住进了罗卡芬达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40340,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "一个连外卖都不愿意送的移民哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43400,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "十六岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44340,
      "end_ms": 45480,
      "text": "他生了一个儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46020,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "孩子他爸是摩洛哥来的油漆工。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48720,
      "end_ms": 49980,
      "text": "熊走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00023",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 51420,
      "text": "希拉没哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51900,
      "end_ms": 54700,
      "text": "她只是从此再也没睡过一个整觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00025",
      "start_ms": 55360,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "她去麦当劳上夜班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00026",
      "start_ms": 57120,
      "end_ms": 59740,
      "text": "晚上十点站到早上六点回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00027",
      "start_ms": 59740,
      "end_ms": 60630,
      "text": "给儿儿子做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00028",
      "start_ms": 60770,
      "end_ms": 61665,
      "text": "哄他睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00029",
      "start_ms": 62010,
      "end_ms": 64245,
      "text": "再去菜市场捡收他的菜叶子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00030",
      "start_ms": 64740,
      "end_ms": 65740,
      "text": "那是他的青春。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00031",
      "start_ms": 66000,
      "end_ms": 68270,
      "text": "十八岁别的女孩化妆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00032",
      "start_ms": 68470,
      "end_ms": 69785,
      "text": "她在洗油烟机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00033",
      "start_ms": 70370,
      "end_ms": 72480,
      "text": "二十岁别的女孩谈恋爱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00034",
      "start_ms": 72740,
      "end_ms": 74775,
      "text": "她在暑映必买打折面包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00035",
      "start_ms": 75260,
      "end_ms": 77380,
      "text": "那双被洗涤剂泡得发白的手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00036",
      "start_ms": 77720,
      "end_ms": 81220,
      "text": "后来抱着一个三个月大的婴儿坐了两小时公交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00037",
      "start_ms": 81580,
      "end_ms": 85235,
      "text": "穿越整座巴塞罗那去接一个叫梅西的男人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00038",
      "start_ms": 85810,
      "end_ms": 86885,
      "text": "二零零七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00039",
      "start_ms": 87290,
      "end_ms": 88765,
      "text": "巴萨拍慈善日历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00040",
      "start_ms": 89100,
      "end_ms": 91305,
      "text": "梅西会给几个婴儿洗澡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00041",
      "start_ms": 91850,
      "end_ms": 93990,
      "text": "希腊在报纸上看到这条消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00042",
      "start_ms": 94250,
      "end_ms": 95705,
      "text": "抱起孩子就出发了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00043",
      "start_ms": 96250,
      "end_ms": 97755,
      "text": "他不知道梅西是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00044",
      "start_ms": 98090,
      "end_ms": 98865,
      "text": "他只知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00045",
      "start_ms": 99190,
      "end_ms": 102330,
      "text": "如果这个人能让他的孩子将来过得好一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00046",
      "start_ms": 102510,
      "end_ms": 104955,
      "text": "那他就去那张合影。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00047",
      "start_ms": 105370,
      "end_ms": 106935,
      "text": "希拉存了十九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00048",
      "start_ms": 107510,
      "end_ms": 111255,
      "text": "他大概也不知道照片里那个帮婴儿洗澡的球星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111620,
      "end_ms": 114780,
      "text": "十几年后会把十号球衣脱给他怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00050",
      "start_ms": 114780,
      "end_ms": 119410,
      "text": "那个婴儿穿亚马尔六岁那年在街头踢一颗破网球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00051",
      "start_ms": 119810,
      "end_ms": 121275,
      "text": "希拉看了二十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00052",
      "start_ms": 121620,
      "end_ms": 124365,
      "text": "做了一个让所有人都觉得疯了的决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00053",
      "start_ms": 124870,
      "end_ms": 127165,
      "text": "他把儿子送进了巴萨青训，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00054",
      "start_ms": 127740,
      "end_ms": 128605,
      "text": "邻居笑他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00055",
      "start_ms": 128940,
      "end_ms": 131040,
      "text": "你连报名表上的字都认不全，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00056",
      "start_ms": 131320,
      "end_ms": 132635,
      "text": "你儿子能踢出来？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00057",
      "start_ms": 133090,
      "end_ms": 134210,
      "text": "希拉说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00058",
      "start_ms": 134510,
      "end_ms": 135535,
      "text": "我没读过书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00059",
      "start_ms": 135940,
      "end_ms": 137435,
      "text": "但我认得我儿子的眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00060",
      "start_ms": 137730,
      "end_ms": 140145,
      "text": "他看球的时候眼睛里有光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00061",
      "start_ms": 140610,
      "end_ms": 141510,
      "text": "就这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00062",
      "start_ms": 141890,
      "end_ms": 144255,
      "text": "他开始了长达七年的摆渡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00063",
      "start_ms": 144780,
      "end_ms": 146280,
      "text": "拉玛西亚在城内头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00064",
      "start_ms": 146580,
      "end_ms": 147800,
      "text": "希拉筑城这一头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00065",
      "start_ms": 148060,
      "end_ms": 150915,
      "text": "每周三趟公交来回四个小时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00066",
      "start_ms": 151480,
      "end_ms": 154035,
      "text": "他坐在铁丝网外面不玩手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00067",
      "start_ms": 154390,
      "end_ms": 157370,
      "text": "不聊天就那么看着清旬教练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00068",
      "start_ms": 157370,
      "end_ms": 159165,
      "text": "后来回忆所有孩子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00069",
      "start_ms": 159440,
      "end_ms": 161055,
      "text": "亚马尔不是最有天赋的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00070",
      "start_ms": 161380,
      "end_ms": 162340,
      "text": "但他是唯一一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00071",
      "start_ms": 162340,
      "end_ms": 163135,
      "text": "每次回头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00072",
      "start_ms": 163390,
      "end_ms": 164565,
      "text": "妈妈都在场边的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00073",
      "start_ms": 165090,
      "end_ms": 166970,
      "text": "有一回下暴雨训练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00074",
      "start_ms": 166970,
      "end_ms": 167870,
      "text": "临时取消。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00075",
      "start_ms": 168150,
      "end_ms": 169325,
      "text": "希腊不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00076",
      "start_ms": 169840,
      "end_ms": 174285,
      "text": "他坐了两个小时公交到了发现训练场空无一人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00077",
      "start_ms": 174910,
      "end_ms": 177215,
      "text": "他又坐了两个小时公交回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00078",
      "start_ms": 177870,
      "end_ms": 180235,
      "text": "这件事亚马尔是后来才知道的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00079",
      "start_ms": 180630,
      "end_ms": 182715,
      "text": "他妈从来不说自己吃了什么苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00080",
      "start_ms": 182990,
      "end_ms": 184975,
      "text": "他只说今天天气不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00081",
      "start_ms": 185480,
      "end_ms": 187560,
      "text": "亚马尔十二岁进了拉马西亚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00082",
      "start_ms": 187960,
      "end_ms": 190115,
      "text": "从此他的世界越来越大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00083",
      "start_ms": 190440,
      "end_ms": 196390,
      "text": "梅西欧洲杯十号球衣世界杯希腊的世界一直没变过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00084",
      "start_ms": 196690,
      "end_ms": 203040,
      "text": "还是那个出租屋那双缝鞋的手那趟来回四小时的公交雅马。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00085",
      "start_ms": 203040,
      "end_ms": 205815,
      "text": "尔后来说过两件事一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00086",
      "start_ms": 206110,
      "end_ms": 207405,
      "text": "有一年圣诞节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00087",
      "start_ms": 207770,
      "end_ms": 209725,
      "text": "希拉给他买了一台游戏机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00088",
      "start_ms": 210210,
      "end_ms": 216505,
      "text": "他长大了才知道那台游戏机是他占了多少个夜班才换来的另一件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00089",
      "start_ms": 216780,
      "end_ms": 218205,
      "text": "有一天半夜他醒来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00090",
      "start_ms": 218530,
      "end_ms": 221755,
      "text": "看见他妈在灯下缝他的球鞋鞋底开胶了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00091",
      "start_ms": 222080,
      "end_ms": 224545,
      "text": "他用于线缝封了整整一夜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00092",
      "start_ms": 225080,
      "end_ms": 225700,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00093",
      "start_ms": 225860,
      "end_ms": 227460,
      "text": "他穿着那双鞋去训练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00094",
      "start_ms": 227760,
      "end_ms": 229025,
      "text": "踢进了三个球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00095",
      "start_ms": 229570,
      "end_ms": 230230,
      "text": "亚马尔说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00096",
      "start_ms": 230450,
      "end_ms": 232045,
      "text": "我现在身价两亿欧元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00097",
      "start_ms": 232350,
      "end_ms": 233350,
      "text": "但我什么都给不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00098",
      "start_ms": 233350,
      "end_ms": 233765,
      "text": "我妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00099",
      "start_ms": 234060,
      "end_ms": 236355,
      "text": "因为他给我的东西钱买不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00100",
      "start_ms": 236840,
      "end_ms": 240475,
      "text": "二零二四年亚马尔十七岁拿了欧洲杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00101",
      "start_ms": 241020,
      "end_ms": 244525,
      "text": "二零二五年十八岁接过巴萨十号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00102",
      "start_ms": 245060,
      "end_ms": 246720,
      "text": "全世界都在喊天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00103",
      "start_ms": 247000,
      "end_ms": 250755,
      "text": "只有亚马尔知道天才不是从天上掉下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00104",
      "start_ms": 251120,
      "end_ms": 254560,
      "text": "天才是从罗卡丰达的公交车上坐了七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00105",
      "start_ms": 254600,
      "end_ms": 256520,
      "text": "来来回回才到的诺坎普。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00106",
      "start_ms": 257120,
      "end_ms": 259685,
      "text": "记者问他压力大不大？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00107",
      "start_ms": 260270,
      "end_ms": 261215,
      "text": "他说了一段话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00108",
      "start_ms": 261620,
      "end_ms": 262640,
      "text": "我妈十六岁生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00109",
      "start_ms": 262640,
      "end_ms": 263995,
      "text": "我那才是压力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00110",
      "start_ms": 264360,
      "end_ms": 266580,
      "text": "他一个人在麦当劳站了十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00111",
      "start_ms": 266740,
      "end_ms": 267695,
      "text": "那才是压力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00112",
      "start_ms": 268170,
      "end_ms": 270695,
      "text": "我要做的只是踢好足球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00113",
      "start_ms": 271190,
      "end_ms": 274565,
      "text": "二零二六年世界杯决赛终场哨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00114",
      "start_ms": 275180,
      "end_ms": 276385,
      "text": "西班牙赢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00115",
      "start_ms": 276990,
      "end_ms": 278630,
      "text": "亚马尔穿过整座球场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00116",
      "start_ms": 278890,
      "end_ms": 279870,
      "text": "翻过广告牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00117",
      "start_ms": 280110,
      "end_ms": 280890,
      "text": "冲上看台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00118",
      "start_ms": 281150,
      "end_ms": 282335,
      "text": "一把抱住希拉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00119",
      "start_ms": 282620,
      "end_ms": 284755,
      "text": "把大力神杯塞进他怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00120",
      "start_ms": 285270,
      "end_ms": 287870,
      "text": "然后他转身从人群中抱起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00121",
      "start_ms": 287870,
      "end_ms": 290230,
      "text": "一个三岁的小男孩叫凯恩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00122",
      "start_ms": 290530,
      "end_ms": 291125,
      "text": "他弟弟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00123",
      "start_ms": 291730,
      "end_ms": 294070,
      "text": "他把金牌从自己脖子上摘下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00124",
      "start_ms": 294310,
      "end_ms": 295690,
      "text": "挂在他弟弟脖子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00125",
      "start_ms": 295970,
      "end_ms": 298390,
      "text": "让那只小手去摸大地神杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00126",
      "start_ms": 298990,
      "end_ms": 300590,
      "text": "全世界都在拍亚马尔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00127",
      "start_ms": 300950,
      "end_ms": 301970,
      "text": "亚马尔的镜头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00128",
      "start_ms": 302010,
      "end_ms": 303050,
      "text": "只对着两个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00129",
      "start_ms": 303230,
      "end_ms": 305870,
      "text": "他妈妈和他弟弟他说过一段话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00130",
      "start_ms": 306230,
      "end_ms": 307950,
      "text": "我弟弟每天早晨醒来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00131",
      "start_ms": 308090,
      "end_ms": 308970,
      "text": "有热牛奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00132",
      "start_ms": 308970,
      "end_ms": 310290,
      "text": "喝有玩具玩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00133",
      "start_ms": 310470,
      "end_ms": 311910,
      "text": "有哥哥陪他踢球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00134",
      "start_ms": 312470,
      "end_ms": 313810,
      "text": "这听起来很普通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00135",
      "start_ms": 314410,
      "end_ms": 318970,
      "text": "但这对我来说是我这辈子拼了命也要守护的画面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00136",
      "start_ms": 319550,
      "end_ms": 322940,
      "text": "因为那是我小时候从从来没有过的早晨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00137",
      "start_ms": 323660,
      "end_ms": 325100,
      "text": "希拉三十五岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00138",
      "start_ms": 325700,
      "end_ms": 326720,
      "text": "他十六岁生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00139",
      "start_ms": 327080,
      "end_ms": 329720,
      "text": "十七岁抱着孩子坐公交去见维西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00140",
      "start_ms": 330080,
      "end_ms": 330900,
      "text": "三十五岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00141",
      "start_ms": 330900,
      "end_ms": 332460,
      "text": "站在世界杯领奖台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00142",
      "start_ms": 332760,
      "end_ms": 333900,
      "text": "大儿子十九岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00143",
      "start_ms": 334120,
      "end_ms": 335100,
      "text": "小儿子三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00144",
      "start_ms": 335640,
      "end_ms": 339220,
      "text": "大儿子把所有的荣誉都变成了弟弟手里的玩具。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00145",
      "start_ms": 339760,
      "end_ms": 340900,
      "text": "有人问亚马尔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00146",
      "start_ms": 341060,
      "end_ms": 342940,
      "text": "你职业生涯谁最重要？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00147",
      "start_ms": 343480,
      "end_ms": 344360,
      "text": "他说我妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00148",
      "start_ms": 344960,
      "end_ms": 349580,
      "text": "然后他说小时候我每天最怕的是天亮天亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00149",
      "start_ms": 349940,
      "end_ms": 351375,
      "text": "我妈就要去麦当劳了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00150",
      "start_ms": 351750,
      "end_ms": 353095,
      "text": "家里就剩我一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00151",
      "start_ms": 353690,
      "end_ms": 355295,
      "text": "现在我最怕的是天亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00152",
      "start_ms": 355600,
      "end_ms": 356215,
      "text": "天亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00153",
      "start_ms": 356640,
      "end_ms": 358895,
      "text": "我弟就有新的一天可以去玩了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00154",
      "start_ms": 359450,
      "end_ms": 360395,
      "text": "我不怕黑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00155",
      "start_ms": 360750,
      "end_ms": 362565,
      "text": "因为我把光都留给他了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00156",
      "start_ms": 363110,
      "end_ms": 364910,
      "text": "希拉那天站在领奖台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00157",
      "start_ms": 365210,
      "end_ms": 366750,
      "text": "手里握着大力神杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00158",
      "start_ms": 367110,
      "end_ms": 369395,
      "text": "身边站着他三岁的小儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00159",
      "start_ms": 369930,
      "end_ms": 370725,
      "text": "他没有哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00160",
      "start_ms": 371110,
      "end_ms": 372645,
      "text": "他笑得不知所措。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00161",
      "start_ms": 373280,
      "end_ms": 375320,
      "text": "那个画面被摄影师拍了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00162",
      "start_ms": 375560,
      "end_ms": 377125,
      "text": "后来在网上传疯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00163",
      "start_ms": 377680,
      "end_ms": 379195,
      "text": "照片里只有一个女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00164",
      "start_ms": 379530,
      "end_ms": 381185,
      "text": "手里握着一座奖杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00165",
      "start_ms": 381520,
      "end_ms": 382855,
      "text": "身边站着一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00166",
      "start_ms": 383180,
      "end_ms": 384440,
      "text": "阳光打在他脸上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00167",
      "start_ms": 384600,
      "end_ms": 387275,
      "text": "三十五岁的脸笑得像个小女孩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00168",
      "start_ms": 387770,
      "end_ms": 391555,
      "text": "那张照片底下有一行字是亚马尔后来写上去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00169",
      "start_ms": 392130,
      "end_ms": 392510,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00170",
      "start_ms": 392910,
      "end_ms": 395470,
      "text": "这双手在麦当劳后锄断了十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00171",
      "start_ms": 395470,
      "end_ms": 397745,
      "text": "盘子被洗涤剂泡白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00172",
      "start_ms": 397940,
      "end_ms": 399285,
      "text": "被油烟熏皱了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00173",
      "start_ms": 399540,
      "end_ms": 400795,
      "text": "被生活磨粗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00174",
      "start_ms": 401310,
      "end_ms": 403530,
      "text": "但就是这双手抱我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00175",
      "start_ms": 403530,
      "end_ms": 405875,
      "text": "坐了两个小时公交去见梅西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00176",
      "start_ms": 406480,
      "end_ms": 410265,
      "text": "就是这双手用鱼线给我缝了一整夜的球鞋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00177",
      "start_ms": 410830,
      "end_ms": 413615,
      "text": "就是这双手在无数个凌晨做晚饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00178",
      "start_ms": 413880,
      "end_ms": 414595,
      "text": "看着我吃完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00179",
      "start_ms": 414860,
      "end_ms": 416185,
      "text": "然后自己去上夜班。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00180",
      "start_ms": 416790,
      "end_ms": 417590,
      "text": "十九年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00181",
      "start_ms": 417910,
      "end_ms": 420405,
      "text": "这双手握住了一座大力神碑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00182",
      "start_ms": 420920,
      "end_ms": 422725,
      "text": "我觉得大力神杯很轻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00183",
      "start_ms": 423130,
      "end_ms": 426125,
      "text": "因为他沃国的生活比他重一万倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00184",
      "start_ms": 426730,
      "end_ms": 428330,
      "text": "希腊至今不懂越位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00185",
      "start_ms": 428530,
      "end_ms": 429505,
      "text": "不懂战术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00186",
      "start_ms": 429790,
      "end_ms": 431165,
      "text": "不懂什么清训体系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00187",
      "start_ms": 431670,
      "end_ms": 432905,
      "text": "他只知道一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00188",
      "start_ms": 433240,
      "end_ms": 434480,
      "text": "他儿子喜欢踢球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00189",
      "start_ms": 434700,
      "end_ms": 435785,
      "text": "他就送他去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00190",
      "start_ms": 436340,
      "end_ms": 437365,
      "text": "仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00191",
      "start_ms": 437970,
      "end_ms": 441675,
      "text": "但就是这个连足球规则都搞不清楚的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00192",
      "start_ms": 441940,
      "end_ms": 443835,
      "text": "成了世界冠军的榜样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00193",
      "start_ms": 444380,
      "end_ms": 445775,
      "text": "亚马尔的榜样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00194",
      "start_ms": 446270,
      "end_ms": 447290,
      "text": "十六岁当妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00195",
      "start_ms": 447670,
      "end_ms": 448530,
      "text": "三十五岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00196",
      "start_ms": 448610,
      "end_ms": 450035,
      "text": "站在世界之巅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00197",
      "start_ms": 450580,
      "end_ms": 452035,
      "text": "这双手端过盘子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00198",
      "start_ms": 452300,
      "end_ms": 453555,
      "text": "也捧过奖杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00199",
      "start_ms": 454100,
      "end_ms": 455880,
      "text": "这个女人没踢过一脚球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00200",
      "start_ms": 456180,
      "end_ms": 457120,
      "text": "但她生了冠军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00201",
      "start_ms": 457320,
      "end_ms": 458140,
      "text": "养了冠军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00202",
      "start_ms": 458400,
      "end_ms": 459915,
      "text": "最后活成了冠军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00203",
      "start_ms": 460570,
      "end_ms": 461470,
      "text": "如果有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00204",
      "start_ms": 461570,
      "end_ms": 464405,
      "text": "你在凌晨的麦当劳看见一个收银员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00205",
      "start_ms": 464710,
      "end_ms": 466330,
      "text": "他手上有洗洁精的味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00206",
      "start_ms": 466490,
      "end_ms": 467625,
      "text": "他眼里有困意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00207",
      "start_ms": 467880,
      "end_ms": 468805,
      "text": "他动作很快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00208",
      "start_ms": 469190,
      "end_ms": 470935,
      "text": "因为他急着回家看孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00209",
      "start_ms": 471470,
      "end_ms": 472830,
      "text": "请你对他笑一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00210",
      "start_ms": 473430,
      "end_ms": 475270,
      "text": "他手里端的不是盘子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_70e6e9669f26de22_s00211",
      "start_ms": 475770,
      "end_ms": 477375,
      "text": "是他儿子的未来。"
    }
  ],
